ystery"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/df64232c-cc30-4e9c-92e1-7ccba2b743b0/2bd1a943-ed51-4eef-9693-bb5f25037296.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["es","ru","pt-br","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":7.96,"follows":751,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:35:39.132Z","chapters":[{"id":"33e62809-697e-46d2-bbb9-1d480dd71ff0","number":"19.1","volume":"3","title":"Afterword","lang":"en","pages":1,"createdAt":"2023-03-14T16:50:29+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:09:57.270Z"},"7dbeaa0e-420a-4dc0-b2d3-eb174de266da":{"id":"7dbeaa0e-420a-4dc0-b2d3-eb174de266da","title":"Zippy Ziggy","altTitle":"지피지기","description":"Reputation is everything in a world of icons and popularity contests. So why not score some points here and there by being the nice guy? This is the way Kang Shin-gi legitimizes the fake personality he has everyone believing. Armed with his above average looks and a (completely false) angel-like personality, he has every girl in school head over heels, and all the guys looking to him for guidance. With the exception of having a screwed up cross-dressing devil for a dad, Shin-gi’s life is absolute perfection (*cough* of lies), until one day, Um Seung-hui transfers to his school.  \n  \nWhile being a complete martial artist freak, she also likes to fib just a little in front of those who know her… you know, like acting like she's just a scared little girl who'd play with kittens rather than break brick walls with her head! After all, how can anything go wrong when you're as cute as Seung-hui?  \n  \nFate has brought these two masters of lies together, and the two must battle it out to see who will be crowned the undefeated heavy-weight champion of fakeness!","year":2005,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"86","contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Action","Romance","Comedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/7dbeaa0e-420a-4dc0-b2d3-eb174de266da/192e6a85-80d5-42b4-bdda-81b56592c44f.jpg.512.jpg","ori