se, should I raise him well and completely reform him?\"\n\nShe decides to take the child in and raise him, but...\n\n\"Astraea, where are you going? Are you going to meet that guy again?\"\n\nThe child who she saved becomes an obsessive man who follows her around, monitoring her every move.\n**Somehow... it feels like she might have raised him wrong.**\n\n(Source: Kakao Page, edited)","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/2df4d54a-03f6-4fd0-86df-19986d50dc49/a8e86f9d-273b-4fdf-b267-6cf3d93a2dd6.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["fr","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":7.46,"follows":1070,"listAt":"2026-10-31T05:53:16.972Z","chapters":[{"id":"c5b04907-af3b-4498-b19f-7e0fb8c87b86","number":"5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":18,"createdAt":"2025-09-18T17:17:29+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"54b490a1-6d4c-4aa3-8348-95b30e2e5a8f","number":"4","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2025-09-18T17:16:53+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2cafb97e-9547-4f76-8b93-bf05f3cd1498","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":24,"createdAt":"2025-09-17T16:39:56+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"236d9de9-ad0c-4fcf-9062-4708df371648","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":31,"createdAt":"2025-09-17T16:38:54+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"55a09938-0906-42f0-b769-35b40faf6a99","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":33,"createdAt":"2025-09-17T16:37:11+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":5,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:09:40.877Z"},"8a0f89ab-f8f1-4e53-a9cf-1475a7c48845":{"id":"8a0f89ab-f8f1-4e53-a9cf-1475a7c48845","title":"Yuru~ku Ganbare! Nakamura-kun!!","altTitle":"Keep Going for It! Nakamura!!","description":null,"year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Boys' Love","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://u